 * - cubicBezierAxis(p0: f32, p1: f32, p2: f32, p3: f32, t: f32) -> f32
 * - lodeHeuristic(c1: i32, r1: i32, c2: i32, r2: i32, vWeight: i32) -> i32
 * - stepParticleBatch(ptr: i32, count: i32, dt: f32, gravity: f32, drag: f32) -> i32
